{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93a0315c1bb7d3b172b8174396851cb03019c7403cd7c27343b1f3e836452598", "ja": "（『Starlight Melody!』公演は大盛況の内に\n終了した！　後片付けも済んだし、帰るとするか）", "zh": "（『Starlight Melody!』的公演在盛况之中结束了！\n既然撤场工作也已经完成，准备回去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d362dd428bb9468dd6c496e333693fbbcd5e0d016c5b810f1be1a8141ff6201", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}さーんっ！\n一緒に帰りませんか？", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生～！\n要一起回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5794470e3e04e39233250b76300513963bcbc9c1b3893790939c345505c35637", "ja": "あれ？　未来、まだ帰ってなかったのか？", "zh": "咦？未来，你还没回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "7dfaf2b762b054bcc09da3ae7d5243e5e16766bc81f1d9fa3f6d943d7fd7c5aa", "ja": "はい！　公演、すっご～く楽しかったな～って、\n思い出しながら着替えてたら、遅くなっちゃって。", "zh": "是啊！因为我一边回想公演中很～开心的时刻\n一边换衣服，所以才弄到这么晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "e110f3fb9e513c6c33e517a8cd897548e550b95ae194c10a477b54eb6c4b27ea", "ja": "せっかくだから、{$P$}さんと\n一緒に帰ろうと思って、待ってたんです♪", "zh": "既然难得有这机会，我才会在这边等，\n想说和{$P$}先生一起回去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9b87eb223f14cf1587bd4507478fe8e4dd47cc2ecfb64440e8aa2eeabb4ff70f", "ja": "やれやれ。今日はもう仕方ないけど……遅くなる時は\n先に帰るように！　家まで送るから、帰ろう。", "zh": "真是的。今天就算了……下次要是时间太晚，\n你就自己先回去！今天我送你回家，走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea19b71e8d0a68f25c4fc5cd3775e230d8735699777526c50e8f6a3c4a20f6c2", "ja": "は～い♪　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好～♪谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "6180be4ecd763b4ee0ed3f2b42ba523c7d4e57a51b2070bac30153daea647150", "ja": "えへへ♪　なんか、夜に{$P$}さんと\n一緒だと、思い出しちゃいますねっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪和{$P$}先生一起走在\n夜晚的路上，就会回想起来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b064c628aa14e44ed494c6ccd2087052b111aec7c8a25cc032567d9b3078c863", "ja": "ん？　何を思い出すんだ？", "zh": "嗯？回想起什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "909c0cfeda49cc36bcdd27994bfc740dfacb4325a77d7885ce442fe0a28c8579", "ja": "流星群を見に行った時のことです。\nほら、今日は星もいっぱい！", "zh": "回想起去看流星雨的时候。\n你看，今天也有好多星星！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2ef08366f28ae2de29f73b2c9fb78b4fef07da0264219ff10376b4ffc5a62b65", "ja": "そういえば、今日はいつもより星がよく見える\nような……。空気が澄んでるのかもな。", "zh": "经你这么一说，今天的星星好像比平时还多……\n也许是空气比较清澈的关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "d374509623913b51481d5dc3c751b5853cfc8583591ee730fa0783775ee280e6", "ja": "すごかったですよねー、星空と流星群……♪\nあ、そういえば……。", "zh": "真的很不得了对不对～？星空和流星雨……♪\n啊，对了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "b92cebffe70cbc2bc72d03bf8c0d706f5b0c4e0f26e73b2ba8cb7291fec4ef2f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n流れ星に、何かお願いごとしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你有对流星许什么愿望吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ea4da92e009c919125d67cff74c4643309629438d7affcf164290dbd82d3c62f", "ja": "願い事……？\nそういえば、忘れてたな。未来は？", "zh": "愿望……？\n这么一说，我忘记许愿了。未来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "98a07f4231aeddc51beafb4e88e8556b7c7feca714c36e94efe1bb233c5652ff", "ja": "私も忘れてたんです！\n流れ星の数は、数えてたんですけど～。", "zh": "我也忘记了！\n我只顾着数流星有几颗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "356fb7371065eb3870fb5dce633a1d05e6a0951bc2bc329a543ac0b098d5d6e5", "ja": "はは、数を数えるのに夢中になっちゃったのか。\n未来らしいな。", "zh": "哈哈，数流星到忘我了吗？\n真有未来的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "67b32062543b694677bddc3932e4b940696da7fe14a9b8b9c04145174fed6781", "ja": "だって、次から次に流れてたじゃないですか～。\nだから忙しくて……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "因为，流星一颗接一颗划过天空嘛～\n所以我才会忙着……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "38806658512a5bab17f43e39127df62a4f7259aa400f47b41bd75c9f4f348cc5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n今から一緒にお願いごと、してみませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n现在要不要跟我一起许愿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "5fc508e739be4ae0bdb95e121f5553b7ff58547254ae27f1bd78d6fd1a302ffb", "ja": "流れ星じゃないですけど、今日の星空もすっごく\nキレイだし。お願いごと、叶っちゃうかもです♪", "zh": "虽然没有流星，但今晚的星空也很漂亮。\n也许可以实现愿望喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c6c0dcab199dbfc844cad1cac647c6c203a04cb0649a7f11bef2e8e09bbf54e5", "ja": "おっ、なるほど。\nそれで未来は、何をお願いするんだ？", "zh": "喔！原来如此。\n那未来，你要许什么愿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "62523f1d9a42b480ac3c6798c63ddf58734cb7633bc2efdc2e7902ab5f652625", "ja": "えっ？　あ、そっか、お願いごと……。\nえっと、えっと～。", "zh": "咦？啊，对喔，愿望……\n呃，我想想～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb3a681f329066e56a2621bab206e0f185616ed806a53b637777f127e53a41be", "ja": "あ、はーい！　私のお願いごとは、\n『今日みたいなライブを、たくさんやりたい』です♪", "zh": "啊，有了！我的愿望是，\n『希望可以再举办好多次像今天一样的演唱会』♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2006164c567e9526312172738a45825cd5c13276ab8189142b14d64245791cb3", "ja": "へえ、いいお願いごとじゃないか。\nアイドルとしても満点だぞ、未来！", "zh": "哦？这愿望很不错呢。\n以一个偶像来说算是满分喔，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "06e1e80f77ee4c760fa36a9243b76596ab0e3007ee4c3afc866c525077a5387e", "ja": "でへへ～♪\n次は{$P$}さんの番ですよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪\n换{$P$}先生许愿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9841ce68896712859df27fe47815c0809e98e116228e239a6a639b5d51b1f4bb", "ja": "よし。それじゃ、俺の願い事は……。", "zh": "好。我想想，我希望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_1025", "source_sha256": "e5cc5947ed8fafe5a6cd1423c9a7150c8d3ac7edfbee4e006a6431f59bdc73ce", "ja": "（願う）", "zh": "（许愿）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "5671d081cc51041f3cab975cf9d4307b0e804927085d210ff9214e217dd8d7aa", "ja": "？　{$P$}さん？", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2002_p", "source_sha256": "84169516d77f0b8808a12e5e5eb67f592395060cfc7dac331631613e392ec033", "ja": "よし、終わったぞ。\nさて、帰ろうか！", "zh": "好，我许完了。\n走吧，回去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2003_014mir", "source_sha256": "b1a22b1d5695a9267d88c37b918e5c198a95a5adf4bfd182455118e37bd9fb59", "ja": "えええっ、教えてくれないんですか！？\n{$P$}さん、ずるい～！", "zh": "咦──！？你不告诉我愿望吗！？\n{$P$}先生，你太诈了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2004_p", "source_sha256": "60c7b3d7a3062649123960c9bc7c03dcb7f74a33b4473d13eab1ccf043354282", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。いつか願いが叶ったら、\nちゃんと教えるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n等以后愿望实现时，我就告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "49b5b042db0798629a03a0509f3c4de2b108ac80906f61c49e97762f398f7842", "ja": "うう～。絶対、絶対ですからねっ。\n約束ですからねっ！", "zh": "呜呜～一定、一定要告诉我喔！\n我们一言为定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2006_p", "source_sha256": "7b4cde162a9f449bc368e0e174206fba728d3228117f5be2424649da0f8f60f6", "ja": "（頬をふくらませて拗ねている。\n嫌われないうちに、しっかり願いを叶えないとな）", "zh": "（未来鼓着脸颊开始闹别扭了。\n得趁她还没讨厌我之前，赶快实现愿望才行呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0093_2007_p", "source_sha256": "6bb4b07f5e15b4f5f3f45c2a5ee5519b5d88a21221db84dcc36c41086afbfd33", "ja": "（未来の願いを、プロデューサーとして\nたくさん叶えてあげられますように）", "zh": "（身为制作人，\n希望我能替未来实现许许多多的愿望。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
